---
import '../styles/global.css';
const title = "Best Mic Under 2000 for YouTube in India (2026) - Tested Picks";
const desc = "5 best mics under Rs 2000 for YouTube, Reels in India: Boya BY-M1, K8 wireless, Fifine K669B. Real prices, noisy room advice.";
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={desc} />
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-gray-900">
<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-6">
<a href="/" class="text-sm text-indigo-600 font-bold">← SetupKaro</a>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Affiliate disclosure: links may earn us commission at no extra cost to you.</div>
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1">Best Mic Under 2000 for YouTube India</h1>
<p class="text-gray-600 mt-1">If audio is bad, video fails. These 5 work in fan noise + traffic. Prices from Amazon.in Sept 2026.</p>

<div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4">
<div class="font-bold">Quick winner: Boya BY-M1 Rs 999</div>
<div class="text-sm">Wired, no battery, works with phone + PC. Best for beginners. <a href="#" class="text-blue-700 font-bold">Check price →</a></div>
<div class="font-bold mt-2">Reels winner: K8 Wireless Rs 1499</div>
<div class="text-sm">No wire, 10hr battery, Type-C + iPhone. <a href="#" class="text-blue-700 font-bold">Check price →</a></div>
</div>

<div class="space-y-4 mt-5">
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="font-bold">1. Boya BY-M1 - Rs 999 - Best overall</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">6m cable, clear voice, needs Open Camera app on Xiaomi/Realme sometimes. No charging.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price on Amazon →</a></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="font-bold">2. K8 Wireless - Rs 1499 - Best for Reels</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Plug-play, 20m range, noise cut for street. Enable OTG on phone.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="font-bold">3. Fifine K669B USB - Rs 2549 (stretch)</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Only if PC videos. Cardioid rejects fan noise. Over 2000 but worth if desk setup.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="font-bold">4. Humble HB-C01 Type-C - Rs 699</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Cheapest Type-C wired. No battery. Good backup.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="font-bold">5. Grenaro Dual - Rs 1999 - Interviews</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">2 mics, 50m range, reverb mode. For 2-person videos.</div><a href="#" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mt-2 text-sm">Check price →</a></div>
</div>

<h2 class="font-extrabold text-xl mt-6">Noisy room? Which to buy</h2>
<p class="text-sm leading-6">Fan + traffic = need close mic. Wired lapel (Boya) beats USB condenser in noisy bedroom. Wireless K8 DSP filters better than cheap Rs 500 mics. Foam cover cuts wind, not fan - keep mic 15cm from mouth.</p>
<h2 class="font-extrabold text-xl mt-4">FAQ</h2>
<p class="text-sm"><b>Will it work with Realme/Xiaomi?</b> Yes, enable OTG for wireless, use Open Camera for wired if native camera ignores mic.</p>
<p class="text-sm"><b>Wireless under 2000 reliable?</b> K8 yes for Reels, but wired Boya clearer for long YouTube.</p>
<p class="text-sm mt-3">Also try: <a href="/tools/budget-builder" class="text-blue-700 font-bold">Budget builder under Rs 5000 →</a> | <a href="/tools/freelance-rate-calculator" class="text-blue-700 font-bold">Rate calculator →</a></p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
